# W3C OWL 2 Conformance Test Fixture
# Source: OWL 2 Structural Specification S9.1 - EquivalentClasses / DisjointClasses
# Reference: https://www.w3.org/TR/owl2-syntax/#Equivalent_Classes

@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .

ex:testOntology a owl:Ontology .

ex:Person a owl:Class .
ex:Human a owl:Class .
ex:Cat a owl:Class .

ex:Person owl:equivalentClass ex:Human .
ex:Cat owl:disjointWith ex:Person .
